        {
          "title": "Open ATAK's Settings",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap ATAK's menu at the top right, then <strong>Settings</strong> in the last row. Tap <strong>Tool Preferences</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/8faacb123b867ed2.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2720
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Find OD Matrix",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Specific Tool Preferences</strong>, then scroll to <strong>OD Matrix Preferences</strong> and tap it.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/52e458e9591a9b19.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2720
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "OD Matrix Preferences",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>ATAK heads the page Plugin Preferences. Tap <strong>Notify me in ATAK about</strong> to choose what you hear about.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/848873a4915f750f.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2720
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Choose what notifies you",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Pick what ATAK tells you about. <strong>Direct messages and mentions</strong> is the default.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/7901a0cf24075f67.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2720
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Get a notification",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>A notification names the chat and how many messages are new, never the text.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/0e45ad8d93e0c42e.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2720
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Open the chat",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap the notification to open the chat. The new message is last.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/beb3736f53251a40.webp",
